        "created_at": "2012-09-24T17:49:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So are you two the same person, only Rabit is what's left after the chainsaw has done its job?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And to add I agree with Rabit and Chainsawrabbit's interpretation, if the Golems were meant to be restricted to only entering via Unity's powers &nbsp;they could easily have been worded \"Can only enter play via <em>Bot-Hack</em>\" or \"... via other Unity cards\". (my copies are still winging their way over the Atlantic so I don't know the full deck yet).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hmmm, I guess the Atlantean Font of Power can also play Golems.</p>",
